 * overdue flags" — a plain badge on the ticket, same "levels with no SLA timer" scope as e.g.
 * purchase requisitions have today. Ordered low to high so a natural ordinal sort (or a simple
 * {@code compareTo}) ranks them correctly if ever needed; nothing in this module currently relies
 * on that ordering, but it costs nothing to declare them this way.
 */
public enum HelpDeskPriority {
    LOW,
    MEDIUM,
    HIGH,
    URGENT
}
